  "question": {
    "text": "The minimum value of the expression&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to (where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi></math> is a complex number)"
  },
